<blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Dose única recomendada</span></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>text</b>: A dose única recomendada é 10 mg, repetida até 3 vezes ao dia. A dose diária máxima recomendada é 30 mg ou 0,5 mg/kg de peso corporal. A duração máxima do tratamento recomendada é 5 dias.</p><p><b>additionalInstruction</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Respeitar um intervalo mínimo de 6 horas entre duas administrações, mesmo no caso de vómitos ou rejeição da dose.</span></p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 1 day</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>10 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></td></tr></table><p><b>maxDosePerPeriod</b>: 30 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span>/1 day<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  coded = 'd')</span></p></blockquote></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Doentes adultos</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Redução da dose a considerar</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Nos doentes idosos deve considerar-se uma redução da dose, com base na função renal e hepática e debilidade geral.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Idosos</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Doença renal em estado terminal (depuração da creatinina ≤ 15 ml/min)</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Nos doentes com doença renal em estado terminal (depuração da creatinina ≤ 15 ml/min), a dose diária deve ser reduzida de 75%.</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Compromisso renal médio a grave (depuração da creatinina 15-60 ml/min)</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Nos doentes com compromisso renal médio a grave (depuração da creatinina 15-60 ml/min), a dose deve ser reduzida de 50%.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Compromisso renal</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Compromisso hepático grave</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Nos doentes com compromisso hepático grave, a dose deve ser reduzida de 50%.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Compromisso hepático grave</span></td></tr></table></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>medicineClassification</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://hl7.org/fhir/medication-classification-type anatomical}\">Código ATC</span></p><p><b>classification</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ATC A03FA01}\">Metoclopramida</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>medicineClassification</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://hl7.org/fhir/medication-classification-type therapeutic}\">Grupo farmacoterapêutico</span></p><p><b>classification</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">6.3.1 - Aparelho digestivo. Modificadores da motilidade gastrintestinal. Modificadores da motilidade gástrica ou procinético. 2.7 - Sistema nervoso central. Antieméticos e antivertiginosos</span></p></blockquote><p><b>clinicalUseIssue</b>: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-ind1.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = indication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-ind2.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = indication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-ind3.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = indication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra1.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra2.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra3.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra4.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra5.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-contra6.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = contraindication</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-Metgen1mgml-CUD-